        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M19",
            "speaker_id": 66260,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, I've created the first drafts for the tax templates (T2) and the tracker (T3). The files are in the shared drive. Please review and let me know your feedback. I included columns for date, department, amount, and a notes field in the tracker.",
