            "speaker_id": 60334,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "Thanks @66260! Taking a look now. The templates look like a good start. For the tracker (A2), could we add a 'Status' column? Something like 'Not Started', 'In Progress', 'Submitted', 'Approved'. It would make it much easier to see where things are at a glance.",
