            "msg_id": "M21",
            "speaker_id": 109659,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "Thanks for the quick turnaround, @66260. I've reviewed the documents. On the templates for T2, we need to ensure they explicitly reference the relevant tax codes for major deduction categories. This is a key requirement from internal audit to make the documentation trail clear. I've left some specific comments in the file.",
