      {
        "thread_id": "TH3",
        "thread_goal": "Lock roles, responsibilities, and reminder/escalation rules.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M39",
            "speaker_id": 60334,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, as per T4, I've drafted the RACI matrix (A5) and a proposal for the reminder/escalation plan (T9). Both are in the shared folder. Please take a look and let me know if the roles and timelines make sense.",
            "mentions": [
              109659,
              66260,
              543897,
              27135
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5",
              "T4",
              "T9"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M40",
            "speaker_id": 543897,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "Thanks @60334! The RACI looks very clear. The reminder plan seems reasonable: 5 days before, 2 days before, and on the due date.",
            "mentions": [
              60334
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M41",
            "speaker_id": 109659,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "Good initiative, @60334. This is a solid draft. One clarification on the RACI (A5): for the 'Final Review Before Filing' step, you have the Tax Clerk as 'Accountable' and the Finance Manager as 'Consulted'. I think the Finance Manager should be 'Accountable' for the filing itself, while the Tax Clerk is 'Responsible' for the preparation. This distinction is crucial for ownership.",
            "mentions": [
              60334
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thinking_face",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M42",
            "speaker_id": 60334,
            "reply_to": "M41",
            "text": "Ah, good catch. That makes perfect sense. I'll swap those roles. Thanks!",
            "mentions": [
              109659
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M43",
            "speaker_id": 66260,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "In the RACI it says I am responsible for checking templates. Does that mean I have to check every single one submitted?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M44",
            "speaker_id": 109659,
            "reply_to": "M43",
            "text": "It means you are responsible for the quality control step, which could involve spot-checking or reviewing summaries, not necessarily every single line item. The person from the department submitting the data is accountable for its accuracy. The RACI clarifies that handover.",
            "mentions": [
              66260
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M45",
            "speaker_id": 66260,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "Ok I understand.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 27135,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "Who is the escalation contact for the sales department?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M47",
            "speaker_id": 60334,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "It's listed in the second tab of the T9 spreadsheet, @27135. It's the regional sales manager.",
            "mentions": [
              27135
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T9"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 109659,
            "reply_to": "M42",
            "text": "With that change to the 'Accountable' role, I think the RACI is ready. Any other comments or concerns?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M49",
            "speaker_id": 543897,
            "reply_to": "M48",
            "text": "Looks good to me.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M50",
            "speaker_id": 109659,
            "reply_to": "M48",
            "text": "Hearing no objections, let's lock it in. Decision: The RACI matrix (A5), with the Finance Manager as Accountable for final filing, is approved.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D5"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "white_check_mark",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M51",
            "speaker_id": 109659,
            "reply_to": "M50",
            "text": "Now for the reminder plan (T9). The proposed frequency seems right. The escalation contacts listed are the department heads. Is everyone comfortable with this?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T9"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M52",
            "speaker_id": 60334,
            "reply_to": "M51",
            "text": "Yes, I've confirmed the contacts with each department's admin.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M53",
            "speaker_id": 109659,
