      {
        "thread_id": "TH4",
        "thread_goal": "Plan and debrief the pilot run of the new workflow.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M55",
            "speaker_id": 66260,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, we need to plan the pilot run for the new workflow (T7). I suggest we use the upcoming monthly VAT filing for the sales department. It's a small filing and usually straightforward.",
            "mentions": [
              109659,
              60334,
              543897,
              27135
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M56",
            "speaker_id": 109659,
            "reply_to": "M55",
            "text": "Thanks for proposing this, @66260. While a simple filing is tempting, I'm concerned it won't properly test the process for handling complexities like cross-department data or adjustments. What about using the Operations department's monthly expense reconciliation? It's more involved and would give us better feedback.",
            "mentions": [
